WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:03.376
Turtle makes another turtle, and you give it a name.

2
00:00:04.179 --> 00:00:08.229
Turtle makes a new turtle. Its name is how you talk to it.

3
00:00:08.954 --> 00:00:13.379
a dot forward moves only a. b dot left turns only b.

4
00:00:15.886 --> 00:00:20.486
Each turtle keeps its own position, its own heading and its own colour.
